  "details": "For unknown reasons Offline/Local Testing is blocked. The blocking message says \"You must fix the errors listed above...\", but no errors are listed. And there are no other error or warnings printed to the console.\n\nI get the same problem in multiple world scenes across the same unity project. All of them use the provided VRCWorld prefab. Restarting the editor and/or device does not solve the problem.\n\nReasoning:\n\nAccording to the language of the interface, the state listed above should be impossible. \n\nExpected Behavior:\n\nOffline testing should either not be blocked or list any errors that are causing the block. Failing that the language should either be changed so it doesn't imply a nonexistent reason or a simple catch-all error should be provided.\n\nEditor Version: 2022.3.6f1\n\nOS Platform: Windows 10 Home\n\nSDK Version: 3.5.2 (box below only accepts an integer)",
